		(property "Design_note" "Female 1x4 2.54mm vertical socket (8.51mm) with the standard HC-SR04 header pinout, so the module plugs straight in. Pin 1 (SENSOR_5V) is on the RIGHT (x=106.81) and GND on the LEFT so a forward-facing HC-SR04 (Vcc,Trig,Echo,Gnd left-to-right seen from the front) mates correctly. 1.02mm finished holes."
